WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:01.200
- What's up, Kicks family?

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:02.068
It's ya boy Meech here,

00:00:02.435 --> 00:00:06.406
back with our debate show "Sneaker Swap,"
where we argue a lot.

00:00:08.107 --> 00:00:08.608
OK,

00:00:08.675 --> 00:00:13.880
I have my usual guys with me: C.J. Toledano,
Christian Pierre and Jeff Johnson.

00:00:13.913 --> 00:00:14.847
What's going on, fellas?

00:00:16.249 --> 00:00:16.516
- Doing good.

00:00:16.516 --> 00:00:17.817
- Doing good, my man. How are you?
- Yo, bro.

00:00:18.351 --> 00:00:19.585
- Exciting, exciting.

00:00:20.153 --> 00:00:22.722
We have a really interesting
topic for today, guys.

00:00:22.789 --> 00:00:23.189
It is:

00:00:23.323 --> 00:00:24.390
If you had

00:00:25.358 --> 00:00:26.459
a Yeezy 350,

00:00:26.559 --> 00:00:28.494
would you trade it for a Nike Roshe Run?

00:00:28.761 --> 00:00:29.629
I know it's crazy.

00:00:29.629 --> 00:00:30.129
It's crazy.

00:00:30.129 --> 00:00:33.266
But talk to me.
- Is this is a prank show?

00:00:35.335 --> 00:00:36.536
- What's the catch?

00:00:38.271 --> 00:00:41.274
What's the catch? Cuz
I'm not doing that.

00:00:41.374 --> 00:00:42.508
I'm keeping the 350.

00:00:42.508 --> 00:00:50.783
It's like, it's like trading the 2020
model of a car for the 2000 version.

00:00:51.150 --> 00:00:51.984
You know what I'm saying?

00:00:51.984 --> 00:00:56.389
Like, it's in the same vein,
and clearly the 350s,

00:00:56.389 --> 00:00:58.491
to me, are the better shoe.

00:00:58.524 --> 00:01:01.294
They're the more sought-after shoe.

00:01:01.327 --> 00:01:03.629
They're probably worth
more than the Roshes.

00:01:03.663 --> 00:01:04.931
It doesn't make any sense.

00:01:04.964 --> 00:01:05.431
- Yeah.

00:01:05.598 --> 00:01:08.868
I'm not trading the 350s
for the Roshe Run, man.

00:01:08.868 --> 00:01:12.538
It almost sounds, like, deranged
talking about it, to be honest.

00:01:13.706 --> 00:01:15.708
I'm not gonna split
the 350s like that.

00:01:15.708 --> 00:01:16.809
The 350s are lowkey

00:01:16.809 --> 00:01:19.912
still some people's grails. Like, maybe
not me personally, but I like ‘em a lot.

00:01:19.912 --> 00:01:21.447
They're grail for a lot of people.

00:01:21.481 --> 00:01:26.219
It's almost like if you were to offer
me, like, 350 Roshe Runs for a 350,

00:01:26.319 --> 00:01:28.388
I'm still picking the 350s.

00:01:28.521 --> 00:01:29.655
This is the Kanye effect.

00:01:29.655 --> 00:01:30.123
What can I say?

00:01:30.656 --> 00:01:33.226
- Listen, I'll play devil's advocate here.
- Oh, boy.

00:01:33.259 --> 00:01:37.797
- We wouldn't have the 350s
if it wasn't for the Roshe Runs.

00:01:38.030 --> 00:01:38.798
- Thank you, C.J.

00:01:38.798 --> 00:01:39.632
Thank you, C.J.

00:01:39.632 --> 00:01:43.636
And honestly, and honestly,
if you took Kanye's name off those

00:01:43.636 --> 00:01:47.673
shoes and you're a Nike loyalist
or if you're a Nike sneakerhead,

00:01:47.673 --> 00:01:51.077
you know? I don't know. I might
pick, I might pick the swoosh over

00:01:51.077 --> 00:01:53.045
just, you know, some Primeknit.

00:01:53.446 --> 00:01:57.016
I mean, and I also don't like a lot
of the colorways of the Yeezy 350s,

00:01:57.016 --> 00:02:02.155
so. And to me, it's just, like,
the ultimate hypebeast indicator.

00:02:02.288 --> 00:02:02.922
So, I’m gonna

00:02:03.389 --> 00:02:05.091
ride with the Roshe
Runs here.

00:02:05.658 --> 00:02:06.492
- Wow.

00:02:06.626 --> 00:02:09.362
- Wow! You're rocking with the Roshes?

00:02:09.362 --> 00:02:11.798
- And listen, I did a
little bit of research.

00:02:12.899 --> 00:02:13.766
We'll get to it.

00:02:13.766 --> 00:02:19.739
I have to spread out my ammo, but,
yeah, I'm comfortable with this.

00:02:19.739 --> 00:02:21.040
I'm comfortable with this.

00:02:21.340 --> 00:02:21.774
- C.J.,

00:02:21.774 --> 00:02:25.211
I can't, I can't say you're wrong.
If it wasn't for the Roshes, like

00:02:25.311 --> 00:02:26.813
there might not be a 350.

00:02:26.813 --> 00:02:28.147
Cuz, like, Kanye said it himself.

00:02:28.147 --> 00:02:32.285
I feel it. But, to be
honest, like, I don't—

00:02:32.852 --> 00:02:35.121
like, I don't know if everybody's talking
about “Did the Yeezy 350s

00:02:35.121 --> 00:02:37.156
replace the Roshes,” right?

00:02:37.356 --> 00:02:41.561
I would think the Ultraboost 1.0s are
the shoe that replaced the Roshes,

00:02:41.561 --> 00:02:44.530
to be honest. And, funny enough, I think
it's got an adverse effect to it because

00:02:44.697 --> 00:02:47.667
what really helped put the Roshes—I’m
sorry, the 1.0s—on, the Ultraboost,

00:02:48.100 --> 00:02:49.235
is when Kanye wore them.

00:02:49.302 --> 00:02:53.039
When Kanye wore ‘em at concerts, when he
wore them at Powerhouse, like, back in,

00:02:53.039 --> 00:02:55.341
like, 2015, I guess, five years ago.

00:02:55.741 --> 00:02:59.779
So, like, he helped elevate the
Ultraboost to what it was at that point.

00:02:59.779 --> 00:03:02.682
It was, like, one of the hottest shoes
in the streets and market at that time.

00:03:03.049 --> 00:03:03.816
And then it's crazy

00:03:03.816 --> 00:03:06.252
cuz even, like, later that year,
obviously the 350s dropped.

00:03:06.319 --> 00:03:10.022
So, like, they were both so fly, but
it’s obviously, like, levels to it,

00:03:10.022 --> 00:03:10.389
you know what I mean?

00:03:10.389 --> 00:03:12.658
Like, it was, like, Ultraboosts
here, 350s here.

00:03:12.725 --> 00:03:14.961
Roshe is, like, way below,
underneath the screen here.

00:03:14.961 --> 00:03:18.531
- So, I—Christian, I agree with
you, man, but I don't wanna discount

00:03:18.531 --> 00:03:20.166
the real hype of the Roshe,

00:03:20.166 --> 00:03:20.366
right?

00:03:20.366 --> 00:03:25.638
This is a sneaker that originally
debuted in 2012 for $70, right?

00:03:25.705 --> 00:03:28.040
- Yeah, yeah.
- At that time, that price point is unfathomable.

00:03:28.341 --> 00:03:30.977
You know, I can take—Mom’s
taking me to the store, you

00:03:30.977 --> 00:03:34.814
know, a senior high school Meech,
and I can get two, three pairs,

00:03:34.981 --> 00:03:38.150
that's the price of, you know,
what one Ultraboost was.

00:03:39.452 --> 00:03:43.256
And at the time, you know, the
Roshe Run was, like, really an athlete’s shoe,

00:03:43.256 --> 00:03:47.560
you know? It was, it was what—now we
have the slides, but you know, at,

00:03:47.627 --> 00:03:54.066
