00:04:11.884 --> 00:04:12.451
It's like, “Fam,

00:04:12.451 --> 00:04:12.785
OK,

00:04:12.785 --> 00:04:14.754
I know. You're
‘for the culture.’

00:04:14.754 --> 00:04:18.124
You know. You're
high fashion.”

00:04:18.391 --> 00:04:18.658
Fuck

00:04:18.658 --> 00:04:19.091
outta here!

00:04:19.091 --> 00:04:19.926
Like, what are you wearing?

00:04:20.126 --> 00:04:21.694
And the suit wasn't even tapered!

00:04:21.761 --> 00:04:26.699
So what type of, like—he was
wearing, like, the LeBron ‘03

00:04:26.799 --> 00:04:31.871
