rack because you know you makin’ millions,

00:04:31.871 --> 00:04:34.173
so, you know, “Forget a tailor.

00:04:34.173 --> 00:04:35.007
I'm trying to get paid.

00:04:35.007 --> 00:04:37.109
I'm trying to shake David
Stern’s hand.” Like that.

00:04:37.410 --> 00:04:41.347
So, yeah, man, I'm here to be
swayed because I totally agree.

00:04:41.380 --> 00:04:44.984
If it didn't say Yeezy, it would
be in Marshalls right now,

00:04:45.217 --> 00:04:46.552
