back to the Roshe Run and obviously,

00:05:33.799 --> 00:05:36.168
you know, the price point on these,
on these Yeezys are still 200,

00:05:36.168 --> 00:05:37.937
250, the Roshe one was $70, man,

00:05:37.937 --> 00:05:39.038
I can get all my colors.

00:05:39.639 --> 00:05:41.540
But at least I had
variety. With the Yeezys,

00:05:41.540 --> 00:05:42.942
