00:06:20.913 --> 00:06:23.649
I mean, he did, but is
it because we're stupid?

00:06:23.916 --> 00:06:28.654
I mean, I just—yeah, I just, I
wanna make sure that we know that

00:06:29.588 --> 00:06:30.756
the Roshes walked

00:06:30.790 --> 00:06:32.024
