00:11:05.397 --> 00:11:11.270
Aren't there, like, shoe deals
that basketball players sign where they

00:11:11.270 --> 00:11:14.807
say, “When I'm on the court, I have to
wear this sneaker, but off the court, I

00:11:14.807 --> 00:11:16.642
can wear whatever”?
- We gotta realize,

00:11:16.642 --> 00:11:17.176
we're here,

00:11:17.176 --> 00:11:18.410
we're talking about sneakers.

00:11:18.410 --> 00:11:20.512
The game is the game because of Jordans.

00:11:20.512 --> 00:11:25.351
And, like, we love when brands are
self-aware, and I almost think it'd be a

00:11:25.351 --> 00:11:29.488
good look on Adidas to be like, “Listen,
we're gonna give the tiniest shout-out

00:11:29.488 --> 00:11:31.623
to Jordans for getting us here.

00:11:32.024 --> 00:11:35.694
So you can wear a Jordan, especially
since you're from Chicago.” But also

00:11:35.694 --> 00:11:37.763
too, like, Kanye is not the only one.

00:11:37.763 --> 00:11:40.499
I remember stories growing
up about how Iverson—

00:11:40.499 --> 00:11:42.501
I mean, we remember Iverson
in the college days.

00:11:42.768 --> 00:11:46.872
Like, he's the second most famous
person to make those Concords look

00:11:46.872 --> 00:11:48.974
good to me with those Georgetown unions.

00:11:49.008 --> 00:11:52.177
And then I remember when
Harden signed with Adidas.

00:11:52.344 --> 00:11:52.811
- Yeah.

00:11:52.945 --> 00:11:56.849
- Like, there were those stories coming
out that literally, like, he had signed

00:11:56.849 --> 00:11:59.885
the deal with Adidas, but it didn't
start for another, like, two months.

00:11:59.918 --> 00:12:04.490
And he was wearing Jordans till the
day the Adidas contract started.

00:12:04.490 --> 00:12:09.061
- Like, they had to make the commercial
that Adidas came and dropped off all

00:12:09.061 --> 00:12:11.130
new Adidas. Like, a whole collection.

00:12:11.130 --> 00:12:11.463
They're like,

00:12:11.697 --> 00:12:14.466
“Here's the Adidas collection. Please stop wearing Jordans, Harden.”
- That’s a great point.

00:12:14.800 --> 00:12:18.837
- And so, like, we all gotta admit,
like, all these Adidas and Reebok

00:12:18.837 --> 00:12:22.241
and whoever else is out there, Wade,
all these people, they definitely

00:12:22.241 --> 00:12:23.475
have Jordans in their collection.

00:12:23.475 --> 00:12:25.377
They're definitely wearing ‘em
when they're not on camera.

00:12:25.511 --> 00:12:30.149
- If Kanye was to also, you know, leave,
take the Yeezy line, make them on his own,

00:12:31.383 --> 00:12:35.687
could we see it competing
with the Nikes, Adidas,

00:12:35.854 --> 00:12:37.756
Puma, Reebok?

00:12:38.257 --> 00:12:38.957
What do you guys think?

00:12:39.258 --> 00:12:42.428
- It probably would be smart for him to
just link up with another shoe brand for

00:12:42.428 --> 00:12:47.499
distribution. And, you know, that's where
I—that's one of the main reasons why I

00:12:47.499 --> 00:12:52.337
think Big Baller Brand—
- BBB!
- The triple Bs went down.

00:12:52.471 --> 00:12:55.974
Like, you don't need to, you don't
need to place any stronger

00:12:55.974 --> 00:12:57.776
burden on yourself with that.

00:12:57.976 --> 00:13:02.815
Maybe he can go to another—what if
he brings something back like British

00:13:02.815 --> 00:13:05.117
Knights or something nuts like that,

00:13:05.751 --> 00:13:09.254
and makes, like, a Yeezy line of that?
Just makes his own Yeezy but it's

00:13:09.254 --> 00:13:12.391
like “Yo, we’re bringing it back.”
Or what if he goes to Puma?

00:13:12.825 --> 00:13:13.158
- You know,

00:13:13.192 --> 00:13:17.029
we talk about also, like, reenergizing
a line, and the biggest

00:13:17.029 --> 00:13:18.931
thing is retroing stuff.

00:13:19.264 --> 00:13:22.734
How—I can't imagine
Kanye hasn't thought, “Man,

00:13:22.734 --> 00:13:24.837
I wanna retro my Nike Yeezys.

00:13:24.837 --> 00:13:29.441
Like, those are still such,
like, a sacred shoe, you know?

00:13:29.441 --> 00:13:34.847
So, like, If he gets out of his deal,
any sort of deal, a new

00:13:34.847 --> 00:13:39.485
deal that allows him to rerelease
those Nikes and other colorways, like,

00:13:39.651 --> 00:13:44.490
that is a whole untapped potential
right there with retroing Nike Yeezys.

00:13:44.523 --> 00:13:45.791
- C.J., he even said it himself

00:13:45.791 --> 00:13:49.228
that he—I think he said he wouldn't
be mad if Nike retroed his shoe.

00:13:49.528 --> 00:13:49.795
- Yeah.

00:13:50.028 --> 00:13:50.562
He wants ‘em.

00:13:50.562 --> 00:13:52.564
He wants ‘em. He’s
a fan of his own Nikes.

00:13:54.133 --> 00:13:54.433
- C.J.,

00:13:54.433 --> 00:14:00.239
what Jordans do you think Kanye wants to wear?
- The Infrared 6s.

00:14:00.439 --> 00:14:01.006
- Jordan 6s?
- Yeah.

00:14:01.907 --> 00:14:02.307
- Which one did you say?

00:14:02.741 --> 00:14:03.509
Jordan 6s?

00:14:04.209 --> 00:14:05.410
- Yeah, the Infrareds.

00:14:05.944 --> 00:14:06.512
- Wow.

00:14:07.112 --> 00:14:11.049
- I actually remember when he wore those courtside once at MSG.
- Yeah, with the leather pants.

00:14:11.483 --> 00:14:12.384
- Yeah, I forgot about that.

00:14:12.384 --> 00:14:13.018
Wow.

00:14:13.352 --> 00:14:14.086
I was thinking,

00:14:14.653 --> 00:14:16.488
at first I was trying to figure out,
would he wanna wear Off-Whites?

00:14:16.488 --> 00:14:18.790
Cuz he mentioned, like, he wants
to wear his friend's shoes.

00:14:19.158 --> 00:14:21.894
So, like, I'm trying to figure out,
is it, like, an Off-White thing?

00:14:21.894 --> 00:14:25.197
Cuz you know how the, like, when
Virgil and Kanye finally met up again

00:14:25.197 --> 00:14:28.467
at LV at a runway show, like, how big
that was. So I don't know if it's like

00:14:28.467 --> 00:14:30.235
that thing, or maybe some Don C shoes.

00:14:30.302 --> 00:14:30.836
I don't really know.

00:14:30.903 --> 00:14:33.972
- Yeah, it's got—it's Virgil and Don C.
You're telling me—he's gotta

00:14:33.972 --> 00:14:35.641
be—like, they're all on a group

00:14:35.641 --> 00:14:37.743
chat dropping pictures
of their shoes being like,

00:14:37.976 --> 00:14:39.011
“What do you think of these?”

00:14:39.011 --> 00:14:41.613
Like, “Give me some
feedback.” But I feel, yeah.

00:14:41.613 --> 00:14:43.882
I mean, Kanye wants to wear his
friend's creations, you know?

